{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/7fe264c41fd0b2b22d875fe46fad247e.poster.avif?t=1721228439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/7fe264c41fd0b2b22d875fe46fad247e.webm?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/7fe264c41fd0b2b22d875fe46fad247e.mp4?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>YEAH! YOU WANT &quot;THOSE GAMES,&quot; RIGHT? SO HERE YOU GO!<br>NOW, LET'S SEE YOU CLEAR THEM! 2Also known as Those Games 2, this is the second in our series<br>of minigame collections. We've all seen games out there that<br>we've wanted to play to our heart's content, but couldn't.<br>So, we developed this game with cute and comical stickman<br>characters for you to fully, thoroughly, and enjoyably play<br>as many times as you want!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/735c5646df28dbda0779308b2c4babf9.poster.avif?t=1721228439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/735c5646df28dbda0779308b2c4babf9.webm?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/735c5646df28dbda0779308b2c4babf9.mp4?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play through different minigame stages and complete missions<br>in Minigame mode! Clearing all minigame stages will unlock<br>a Rank-Up Challenge, where you can compare your score<br>and clear time to other players in monthly rankings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/4fdc0e5ec297b3cc91c5fcf516de93cf.poster.avif?t=1721228439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/4fdc0e5ec297b3cc91c5fcf516de93cf.webm?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Use the coins you earn in game to win prizes at the Gotcha!<br>machine. Get new titles and plates to customize your player<br>nameplate. There are a total of 30,375,000 combinations<br>to choose from! Make something cool, or funny, or cute,<br>and really express yourself!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/b384f2e3cefc01509030949d3bb2ef00.poster.avif?t=1721228439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/b384f2e3cefc01509030949d3bb2ef00.webm?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744230/extras/b384f2e3cefc01509030949d3bb2ef00.mp4?t=1721228439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Key Features<br>\u30fbSecond in the series of Stickman minigame collections<br>\u30fbCute and comical 3D animations and visuals<br>\u30fbPlay familiar-looking minigames to your heart's content<br>\u30fbCompete against other players from around the world in<br>Rank-Up Challenges<br>\u30fbUse coins to get new plates and titles from the Gotcha!<br>\u30fbCombine plates and titles to create and customize your own<br>Title Plate<br>\u30fbView global leaderboards updated every month in<br>Latest Rankings<br>\u30fbComplete a variety of different missions to earn rewards","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Knock-Back Shooter Expert","path":"https://cdn.aka